{title: Pehle To Kabhi Kabhi Gham Tha}
{artist: Altaf Raja}
{key: C#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#m] Pehale toh kabhi kabhi [B] gam tha,        [C#m] Ab to har pal hi teri yad sata [A] ti hai
[A] Ab to har pal hi teri yad [C#m] satati hai,        [C#m] Pehale toh kabhi kabhi [B] gam tha
[C#m] Ab toh har pal hi teri yaad rula [A] ti hai
[A] Ab toh har pal hi teri yaad [C#m] rulati hai,        [C#m] Pehale toh kabhi kabhi [B] gam tha
[C#m] Magar ye dard-e-judai hai har [A] ghadi ab
[A] Magar ye dard-e-judai hai har [C#m] ghadi ab,        [C#m] Main tujhse kaise kahoon [B] yeh bata
[C#m] Ke teri yad ke sahare ji [A] raha hu,        [A] Ke teri yad ke sahare ji [C#m] raha hu
[C#m] Main tujhse kaise kahoon [B] yeh bata,        [C#m] Ke gam ke ansuo ko khudhi pi [A] raha hu
[A] Ke gam ke ansuo ko khudhi pi [C#m] raha hu,        [C#m] Main tujhse kaise kahun [B] ye bata
[C#m] Na maar dale teri bewafayi [A] muzko,        [A] Na maar daale teri bewafaayi [C#m] mujhko
[C#m] Main tujhse kaise kahoon [B] yeh bata,        [C#m] Na maar dale kahi ye judai [A] muzko
[A] Na maar daale kahi yeh judai [C#m] mujhko,        [C#m] Ae pagali tu kyun ro [B] rahi hai
[C#m] Ke gham to muzko uthana hai [A] judai ka,        [A] Ke gham to muzko uthana hai [C#m] judai ka
[C#m] Ae pagali tu kyun ro [B] rahi hai,        [C#m] Tere liye to sama hai ye [A] shehnai ka
[A] Tere liye to sama hai ye [C#m] shehnai ka,        [C#m] Ae pagali tu kyun ro [B] rahi hai
[C#m] Ke gaon chodna hai mere [A] muqaddar me,        [A] Ke gaon chodna hai mere [C#m] muqaddar me
[C#m] Ae pagali tu kyun ro [A] rahi hai,        [C#m] Ke umr gujregi ab meri yeh [A] safar me
[A] Ke umr gujregi ab meri ye [C#m] safar me
